    "labels": {
      "n0": "Rust / Authority ledger\nMRR Data Backend / Turso\nClaim, budget and fence together\nPersist original consumption",
      "n1": "MRR Data / Turso\nOne physical storage engine\nShared database, private connections\nDurable original outcomes",
      "n2": "Original claim admission\nReserve local and shared capacity\nRetain the exact claim and history\nCommit consumption before effects",
      "n3": "Rust / Final broker\nOwn consumed opportunities\nGuard dispatch and each range\nUnknown exposure remains held",
      "n4": "Shared-domain execution custody\nResolve roots before the snapshot\nShared budget or history orders use\nCurrent Policy constrains actual bytes",
      "n5": "Original task and origin registry\nOne stable task, one original origin\nSource changes retain the same scope\nRecover the original commit decision",
      "n6": "Policy and owner publication\nExclusive Policy and domain changes\nDrain all live execution scopes\nLater releases rejoin the new fence",
      "n7": "Unknown stays held\nRead the original outcome\nNo new claim on a retry\nNo refund from missing evidence"
    }
